<h1>Google sign-in is not configured</h1>
<p>Set <code>Gcp:OAuthGoogleClientId</code> and <code>Gcp:OAuthClientSecretSecretId</code> in configuration, create the secret in Secret Manager, and grant this environment access to read that secret version.</p>
<p><a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index">Home</a></p>
